---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stories
description: Every Wagglesworth Estate story, grouped by series and category, in episode order.
extraScripts: ["/assets/js/search.js"]
---
<h1>Stories</h1>
<p>
    Every adventure from the Estate, organized by series and category rather than by
    date. The six-episode Royal Summer mystery stays together in order; everything
    else is grouped by the kind of adventure it is.
</p>
<p class="needs-confirmation">
    These are restored full-story editions, rebuilt from the finished plots, character
    details, and jokes that were preserved — not word-for-word transcripts of the
    original posts. See the About page for the full note.
</p>

<form id="story-search-form" role="search">
    <label for="story-search-input">Search stories</label><br>
    <input type="search" id="story-search-input" name="q" placeholder="Search titles, characters, summaries…" style="min-height:44px; padding: 0 var(--space-2); width: 100%; max-width: 30rem;">
</form>
<p id="story-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

<section aria-labelledby="royal-summer-heading">
    {% include "partials/silver-rose.njk" %}
    <h2 id="royal-summer-heading">Royal Summer / Silver Rose Series</h2>
    <ol style="padding-left: 1.25em;">
        {% for story in collections.stories | storiesForSeries("royal-summer") %}
        <li data-story-url="{{ story.url | url }}">
            <a href="{{ story.url | url }}">{{ story.data.title }}</a>
            {% if story.data.summary %} — {{ story.data.summary }}{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>
</section>

{% for coll in site.storyCollections %}
{% set collStories = collections.stories | storiesInCollection(coll.id) %}
{% if collStories.length %}
<section aria-labelledby="coll-{{ coll.id }}-heading">
    <h2 id="coll-{{ coll.id }}-heading">{{ coll.label }}</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left: 1.25em;">
        {% for story in collStories %}
        <li data-story-url="{{ story.url | url }}">
            <a href="{{ story.url | url }}">{{ story.data.title }}</a>
            {% if story.data.summary %} — {{ story.data.summary }}{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
